  "details": "On Live, the Log Viewer settings at the top (Expand, Scroll, Log, etc.) would stay at the top, even if you scrolled to the bottom of the logs.\n\nIn the new Log Viewer, these settings scroll along with the log. This makes it so that, if you've accumulated a lengthy log, and want to change one of these settings, you have to scroll all the way to the top, change it, and then scroll back down.\n\nI think it would better match the Live behavior of the logs and also be less tedious if these settings stayed \"pinned\" at the top of the Log Viewer window, rather than scrolling with it.",
